{
  "slug": "5-qa.html",
  "number": "5",
  "title": "Q&A",
  "lede": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The questions a panelist may ask, and your answers. Add, edit and delete them here. Answers accept Markdown. Everything is saved to a JSON file on this computer and goes nowhere else."
    }
  ],
  "toc": [],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "callout",
      "kind": "info",
      "title": "How saving works, and how to start it",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A web page cannot write a file by itself, so a tiny local server does it. It runs only on this computer ("
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "text": "127.0.0.1"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "), writes only "
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "text": "tools/doc_site/data/qa.json"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", and keeps the previous version as "
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "text": "qa.json.bak"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ". Start it once, then open the page at the address it prints:"
            }
          ],
          "is_note": false
        },
        {
          "type": "cmd",
          "text": "hulikamote_backend/venv/Scripts/python.exe tools/doc_site/serve.py --open"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Without the server (page opened straight from disk), the page still works: changes are kept in this browser, and "
            },
            {
              "type": "b",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Export JSON"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " / "
            },
            {
              "type": "b",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Import JSON"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " let you save and load a file by hand. The green or yellow bar below tells you which mode you are in."
            }
          ],
          "is_note": false
        },
